   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "What the weather is like",
     "texto": [
      "**Погода** is «weather» (climate). **Какая сегодня погода?** = what is the weather like today?",
      "To describe how the day feels, impersonal forms are used: **холодно** (it is cold), **тепло** (it is mild), **жарко** (it is hot).",
      "To say it is raining or snowing, Russian uses **идёт + phenomenon**: **идёт дождь** (it is raining), **идёт снег** (it is snowing).",
      "**Солнце** = sun (the «л» is not pronounced: «SOHN-tseh»). **Ветер** = wind."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The seasons",
     "texto": [
      "**Зима** (winter), **весна** (spring), **лето** (summer), **осень** (autumn).",
      "To say «in winter», «in spring», etc., the singular instrumental case is used without a preposition: **зимой**, **весной**, **летом**, **осенью**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
